名。親弗、周最與原字保留，魏冉書信子稱按受話限定；孟嘗諸子不補個別子嗣。","surfaces":["親弗"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p011","quote":"其後，秦亡將呂禮相齊，欲困蘇代。代乃謂孟嘗君曰：「周最於齊，至厚也，而齊王逐之，而聽親弗相呂禮者，欲取秦也。齊、秦合，則親弗與呂禮重矣。有用，齊、秦必輕君。君不如急北兵，趨趙以和秦、魏，收周最以厚行，且反齊王之信，又禁天下之變。齊無秦，則天下集齊，親弗必走，則齊王孰與爲其國也！」於是孟嘗君從其計，而呂禮嫉害於孟嘗君。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p011","text":"其後，秦亡將呂禮相齊，欲困蘇代。代乃謂孟嘗君曰：「周最於齊，至厚也，而齊王逐之，而聽親弗相呂禮者，欲取秦也。齊、秦合，則親弗與呂禮重矣。有用，齊、秦必輕君。君不如急北兵，趨趙以和秦、魏，收周最以厚行，且反齊王之信，又禁天下之變。齊無秦，則天下集齊，親弗必走，則齊王孰與爲其國也！」於是孟嘗君從其計，而呂禮嫉害於孟嘗君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"呂禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004363","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004349","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"代","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004349","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"周最","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004364","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004345","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"親弗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004365","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"呂禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004363","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m011-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"親弗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004365","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shi